    "audience": "new_adult",
    "elexio_form_id": "6af8cf45-c248-4395-83b8-d1b1500c06b7",
    "title": "Camp Hope 2026 - New Adult Volunteers",
    "intro_text": "Adult Volunteer (18+ at time of Camp Hope)\n\nIf you are a new volunteer, if the last time you served at Camp Hope was more than one year ago, or if your personal information has changed since last year, please use this form to register.\n\nThank you for your interest in volunteering at Camp Hope! We are very grateful.\n\nOne of main elements that makes Camp Hope such a special week is the presence of Christ filled volunteers to love and serve our campers throughout the week. In years past many parents, siblings, friends, and neighbors have volunteered to serve in every area of camp and the result is the same – they leave feeling like they received more than they gave! There is something about emptying ourselves in loving service towards others that allows Christ to then fill us up and meet our every need. Volunteers of the past have taken time off work, made arrangements for younger children and travelled great distances in response to the Lord’s invitation to serve at Camp. Will you answer that call?\n\nThe process to apply as a volunteer is as follows:\n\n• Complete online volunteer application\n\n• Wait to be contacted regarding volunteer confirmation.\n\n• If accepted as a volunteer, follow the instructions emailed to you. Volunteers 18+ need to complete additional steps to serve at Camp Hope. Those requirements can be found HERE (https://docs.google.com/document/d/1iTb1x99kkmPN1uIwtYP9Jkue3UntbBePSTEP-QooTfQ/edit?usp=sharing)\n\nNote that due to space limitations and specific role needs, not all volunteers applying will be able to serve at Camp Hope. Application submission does not ensure acceptance as a volunteer.\n\nAdult volunteers 18+ are eligible to serve in the following areas:\n\n• Kitchen Crew\n\n• In Cabin Support\n\n• Nursing (valid license required)\n\n• Service Crew\n\n• Admin & Prep Work\n\n• To note again, accepted and confirmed adult volunteers will need to complete the additional steps found HERE (https://docs.google.com/document/d/1iTb1x99kkmPN1uIwtYP9Jkue3UntbBePSTEP-QooTfQ/edit?usp=sharing)",
    "success_text": "Thank you for volunteering to serve at Camp Hope.\n\nYour application is being reviewed and Camp Hope staff will be in communication with you in the near future.\n\nIf you are a high school volunteer, please download the volunteer recommendation form HERE. (https://www.camphoperegistration.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Camp-Hope-High-School-Volunteer-Recommendation-Form-2026.pdf) Completed forms must be scanned/photographed and uploaded onto the Camp Hope website or you can use THIS LINK (https://form.jotform.com/211527447357055). Your volunteer application will not be complete until this has been received.\n\nThank you, and please keep Camp Hope in your prayers.",
    "submit_label": "Register",
