        "field_key": "text_1",
        "label": "",
        "help_text": "A Camp Hope Recommendation Form must be submitted for you by an adult in your life who is familiar with your character, faith, & personality. Suggestions would be your youth minister, parish priest, coach or teacher. Please download this form (https://www.camphoperegistration.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Camp-Hope-High-School-Volunteer-Recommendation-Form-2026.pdf) from the documents area on the website and have your reference scan and email the completed form to camphope.poh@gmail.com",
